      "subsections": [
        {
          "id": "2a",
          "title": "Chronological timeline",
          "bullets": [
            {
              "id": "2a.1",
              "text": "On 2026-06-23, PPHI issued warnings and deployed assistance for Verlow; on 2026-06-25, the network operator issued warnings and Grennet Power deployed amid hospital service disruptions; on 2026-06-26, Marnest substation was destroyed and injuries were confirmed in Verlow; on 2026-06-27, people moved away from Verlow due to displacement and the warning period was cited as causing deaths; on 2026-06-28, PPHI issued further warnings and the heatwave was linked to deaths; on 2026-07-01, Grennet Power deployed and revised its policy, assistance was provided in Hetton Rise, and dangerous conditions were present at Hetton Rise and Camber Green.",
